-- ============================================================================
-- DR6 PROFESSIONAL DEEP SEED: Casing & Tubing Design, intermediate tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed.
--
-- What this tier owns: the load case, and the comparison. A load case is TWO
-- pressure columns and an axial profile on a 51 point grid down the true
-- vertical depth, and both columns are carried separately because the triaxial
-- check needs them separately. Seven canonical cases cover the life of a
-- string. The evaluation scans every grid point inside every section and keeps
-- four minima independently, because the four loads peak in four places.
--
-- THE FINDING, AND m02 IS BUILT ON IT. The slope of the burst differential is
-- the inside gradient less the outside one, so the governing end of a section
-- is decided by a comparison most people never write down. On the GAS KICK the
-- gas column loses 2300 Pa per metre while the seawater backup gains
-- 10100.8495, so the differential shrinks downward at 7800.8495 Pa per metre
-- and section 1 governs at ZERO metres of true vertical depth, the wellhead,
-- at 1.6904923854809817. On the PRESSURE TEST the mud column outweighs the
-- backup and the same section governs at its deepest sampled point. Two burst
-- cases on one string, and their governing depths are at opposite ends of it.
-- A check that evaluated only the section bottom would have reported
-- 2.396900745393525 for the gas kick, overstating the margin by 41.8 percent,
-- and would have been exactly right on the pressure test, which is what makes
-- that class of defect survive.
--
-- A SECOND FINDING, IN m05, AND IT IS THIN ON PURPOSE. Thirteen of the
-- fourteen section evaluations PASS and the fourteenth is a WARNING on the
-- pressure test in section 2. It was produced by the TRIAXIAL check and not by
-- the burst check the case is named after: triaxial reads 1.3684762565196722
-- against a warning threshold of 1.375, while burst reads 1.2123376873879477
-- against 1.2100000000000002 and clears it by 0.0023376873879474847. The
-- conclusion is true and it is two thousandths deep, and m05 l03 is entirely
-- about saying both of those things at once.
--
-- A THIRD, IN m03. The published partial evacuation level lands at
-- 1504.7518195805999 m, BELOW the section break, so section 1 is byte
-- identical between the partial and full evacuation cases while section 2
-- differs by 47 percent. Dropping full evacuation from the suite would leave
-- section 1 unchanged and hand section 2 a 47 percent improvement it has not
-- earned.
--
-- Numeric sweep and tier-leakage sweep as for the Associate tier: 0
-- unresolved literals, 0 downward leaks, 0 same-tier answer prints.
--
-- Answer keys live only here and in academy_quiz_questions, which has no
-- client SELECT policy.
-- ============================================================================

